      "text": {
        "jp": "一部の敵はとても強力な攻撃を使います。\r\n \r\nブレイクすることで、危険行動を止めることができます。\r\nブレイクを狙える場合は、積極的に狙っていきましょう。\r\n\r\n難しいときは「ぼうぎょ」で守りを固めるのも良いでしょう。",
        "official_en": "Some enemies can unleash savage blows, which you\r\ncan prevent by staggering them.\r\n\r\nDoing so will require concerted effort, but if things\r\nare looking grim, remember that you can always\r\nselect Defend to bolster your guard.",
        "real_en": "Some enemies use extremely powerful attacks.\r\n\r\nYou can stop these dangerous actions by Breaking the enemy. If you have a chance to Break an enemy, take it!\r\n\r\nIf that proves difficult, choosing Defend to protect yourself is another option."
      },
